2019-05-13 - Version 1.6.6


[ New Features and Changes ]

 - Enhanced the furniture search that is integrated with Essential Housing Tools
   to allow for exclusion of certain words by using a "-" (minus sign) prefix.

 Example:
   replica -dream
 Would find the item:
   Replica Black Soul Gem
 But not the item:
   Replica Dreamshard

 Example:
   estate -surreal
 Would find items in:
   Serenity Falls Estate
 But not in:
   Coldharbour Surreal Estate


2019-03-15 - Version 1.6.5


[ New Features and Changes ]

 - Updated to better support Essential Housing Tools and to provide
   a brand new, visual user interface that allows you to search directly
   from Essential Housing Tools' Housing Hub.

   To open the Essential Housing Tools Housing Hub, do one of the following:

   * Press ALT + H
   * Type /hub
   * Click the "Home" icon in the game's top-most menu bar
   * Mouse over the "EHT" button and click the "Housing Hub" icon

   Then, just click the "Furniture" tab and browse your furniture across all
   of your characters, homes, storage chests and coffers and your bank.

   Note that you may search your furniture by typing an item name (or partial
   item name), item category (such as "lighting" or even just "light"),
   character name, house name, storage chest or coffer name into the Search
   field at the bottom of the Housing Hub.

 - Updated the "/deco update" command to automatically Reload the User Interface
   once the update is complete.  This will ensure that the data that is collected
   is written to disk permanently, even if you walk away for a coffee and come back
   hours later. ;)


