2018-08-27 - Version 1.4.0


[ New Features and Changes ]

 - Added tracking of furniture in your characters' inventories. Logging in with a character will automatically update their inventory of furniture.
   * A Settings panel, including the option to Delete characters' data, will be added in a future update.


2018-08-23 - Version 1.3.1


[ New Features and Changes ]

 - Further reduced the size of the SavedVariables file to improve load times and memory usage even more.
   * The typical user should see a SavedVariables\DecoTrack.lua size of 100k or less. If it's more than that -- Wow, that's a lot of furniture. :P


[ Fixes ]

 - Fixed an issue that prevented storage coffer and chest contents from being saved permanently.
   * You will have to open each one (that contains furniture) once in order to properly update their contents in DecoTrack.
 - Fixed an issue that could cause storage coffers, storage chests and your bank to report inaccurate quantities of items.


2018-08-22 - Version 1.3.0


[ New Features and Changes ]

 - Added tracking of furniture in your Bank as well as your House Storage Chests and Coffers.
   * Just visit your Bank, Banker or any Storage Chest or Coffer to update the inventory for all Storage Chests, Coffers and your Bank.
 - Added a new "/deco update" command that will automatically port you to every house that you own, updating the DecoTrack furniture database along the way.
   * Just don't move! (But even if you do, just wait -- it'll retry porting to the next house automatically after 30 seconds or so)


2018-08-21 - Version 1.2.0


[ New Features and Changes ]

